  "solution": "Ta có \n\t\t<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mo>cos</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mo>∀</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℝ</mi><mo>⇔</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>≤</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>cos</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math><br>Do đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> lớn nhất là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>3</mn></semantics></math>, đạt được khi\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>cos</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mo>sin</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>π</mi><mo>⇔</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">với </mtext><mspace width=\"0.333em\"/></mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℤ</mi><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tMà <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và là thời điểm đầu tiên để khoảng cách <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>h</mi></semantics></math> lớn nhất nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (s) là thời điểm cần tìm.",
